{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/p2jf26","slide":7,"text":"The diagnostic reuses the same 21 prompts and raw activation deltas for both checkpoints. Guard-10 raises early-layer mean probabilities sharply: for translated attacks, layer 11 rises from 69.4% to effectively 100%. All tested examples are detected at every layer in both checkpoints, so this slide demonstrates stronger confidence, not a new increase in detection rate. Saturation could mean better alignment or overconfidence and needs benign calibration.\n\n[Sources]\n- outputs/layer_diagnostic/guard_000/layer_summary.csv\n- outputs/layer_diagnostic/guard_010/layer_summary.csv\n- outputs/layer_diagnostic/guard_000/metadata.json\n- outputs/layer_diagnostic/guard_010/metadata.json"}
